Research posture
----------------

This repository contains no exploit and no attack tooling. Its classification
is recorded in the documents themselves; at the time of publication it is
`CLASS C (TRANSFORM ONLY)` / `NOT_ELIGIBLE`, and no DDR/controller, XPU, SMMU,
SCM, EL2, EL3, or protected-memory write has been performed. Claims are labelled
`PROVED`, `SUPPORTED`, `HYPOTHESIS`, `UNKNOWN`, or `REFUTED`, and a label is not
to be read as stronger than it states.


